A||||13||gt boy||rate this job please.||||1||
Z||000000||gt boy||09-10-2001||10:40 PM||||how hard is it to change the rear wheel bearings in my 86 gt.<P>on a scale from 1 to 10...what would you rate the difficulty?<P>do i need any special tools?<P>------------------<BR>"it's too bad he had to run out of talent half way through the corner..."||||reg||1
Z||000001||skitime||09-10-2001||10:43 PM||||1-2  Remove wheel, remove axle nut and retaining bolts. Remove hub bearing assembly Reinstall<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG">  <p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 09-10-2001).]||||reg||1
